    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Astrologian 10</p><p>Once per day, the astrologan can cast her psyche into the void of space to attract the attention of a terrible otherworldly being. The dweller in darkness behaves in all ways as if she had cast phantasmal killer. At 17th level, the dweller in darkness can be perceived by more than one creature, as if she had cast weird. The astrologian uses her Wisdom for determining the spell DC for both spells.</p>",
